{"4266960": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "AI Faith: Compute [>_AIFC]", "steam_appid": 4266960, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>AI Faith: Compute  </strong>This is an entertaining idle simulation game featuring hardware assembly and computing power management. In an era when artificial intelligence sweeps across the globe, you will take on the role of a top computing architect. Build high-performance computing clusters to support humanity’s grandest project: Prometheus-S</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Advanced Hardware Customization:</strong> Choose from a library of over 1000 detailed components. Assemble nearly 100 types of unique <strong>Computing Rigs</strong> by selecting the best combinations of processors, motherboards, and cooling solutions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic Performance Management:</strong> It’s all about balance. Master the equilibrium between <strong>Computing Output, Power Consumption, and Heat Dissipation</strong>. Use <strong>Overclocking</strong> to push your hardware to its limits, but manage the risks of system failure carefully.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Technological Progression:</strong> Earn AI Coins for your contributions and reinvest them into a comprehensive Tech Tree. Unlock next-gen computing protocols and cooling innovations to stay ahead of the curve.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Compete in Project Prometheus S:</strong> Join a global race for computing supremacy. Climb the real-time leaderboard by increasing your contribution to the &quot;Prometheus S&quot; project and prove your rank among the world's top architects.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>AI Faith: Compute  </strong>This is an entertaining idle simulation game featuring hardware assembly and computing power management. In an era when artificial intelligence sweeps across the globe, you will take on the role of a top computing architect. Build high-performance computing clusters to support humanity’s grandest project: Prometheus-S</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Advanced Hardware Customization:</strong> Choose from a library of over 1000 detailed components. Assemble nearly 100 types of unique <strong>Computing Rigs</strong> by selecting the best combinations of processors, motherboards, and cooling solutions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic Performance Management:</strong> It’s all about balance. Master the equilibrium between <strong>Computing Output, Power Consumption, and Heat Dissipation</strong>. Use <strong>Overclocking</strong> to push your hardware to its limits, but manage the risks of system failure carefully.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Technological Progression:</strong> Earn AI Coins for your contributions and reinvest them into a comprehensive Tech Tree. Unlock next-gen computing protocols and cooling innovations to stay ahead of the curve.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Compete in Project Prometheus S:</strong> Join a global race for computing supremacy. Climb the real-time leaderboard by increasing your contribution to the &quot;Prometheus S&quot; project and prove your rank among the world's top architects.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul>", "short_description": "AI Faith: Compute This is a computing power idle &amp; trading game. In a world ruled by monopolies, join open-source rebels to birth Prometheus S — the ultimate AI. As master architect, pick components, balance power/cooling, overclock, and expand your empire. Earn AI Coins, dominate and break chains!", "supported_languages":